* changing market structure
* excessive maintenance cost
* operational instability
* statistical degradation

Deprecation shall follow a controlled engineering process.

The required lifecycle is:

```text
Active
   │
   ▼
Deprecation Proposal
   │
   ▼
Engineering Review
   │
   ▼
Research Impact Assessment
   │
   ▼
Approval
   │
   ▼
Deprecated
   │
   ▼
Archived
```

Historical datasets, experiments, and backtests shall remain reproducible following deprecation.

Deprecated features shall not be reused for new production models without undergoing the complete promotion process.

---

## REQ-FEAT-070

Feature deprecation shall require documented engineering approval.

---

## REQ-FEAT-071

Deprecation shall not invalidate historical reproducibility.

