# 47. Change Management

Changes to production features shall be managed using formal engineering change control.

Changes requiring review include:

* mathematical definition
* parameters
* dependencies
* preprocessing
* normalization
* validation rules
* metadata schema
* operational behavior

Every approved change shall include:

* engineering justification
* research justification
* impact assessment
* compatibility assessment
* updated documentation
* revised version identifier

Unreviewed production changes are prohibited.

---

## REQ-FEAT-072

Every production feature modification shall undergo formal change review.

---

## REQ-FEAT-073

Every approved modification shall generate a new feature version when computational behavior changes.

