# 48. Verification Framework

Verification provides objective evidence that Feature Engine requirements have been satisfied.

Verification activities include:

| Verification Activity   | Objective                 |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------- |
| Unit Testing            | Mathematical correctness  |
| Integration Testing     | Pipeline correctness      |
| Regression Testing      | Behavioral stability      |
| Reproducibility Testing | Deterministic outputs     |
| Validation Testing      | Data quality enforcement  |
| Performance Testing     | Operational suitability   |
| Audit Verification      | Traceability completeness |

Verification artifacts shall be retained for every production release.

---

## Verification Principles

Verification shall demonstrate:

* the feature computes correctly
* identical inputs produce identical outputs
* invalid inputs are rejected
* metadata is complete
* dependencies are satisfied
* operational rules are enforced

Verification shall occur before production deployment.

---

## REQ-FEAT-074

Every production feature shall successfully complete the defined verification framework.

